, \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>但我一直建议拿1-2成仓做底仓，因为券商的散户太多，需要在这位置震荡洗盘，开启主升浪的时间不确定。如果仓位太重一直震荡你心态就乱了。就算大涨也不要后悔，有的是补仓的时机，现在轻仓是你能拿得住的关键。</span></p><p><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-ratio=\"0.36983729662077597\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMOLbVspO1BcRkkFeOztgycAfxV3JZ2iaDcoyvMRvCkP8X1BLG8xT2fTPic2FhqNVD4q87zc0v3TwEYQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1598\" style=\"\"/></p><p><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>3，医药。</span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>医药今天也放量了。不过是日线的放量，周月线还比较正常。所以只会出现短期回调，中线是没问题的。</span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>现在先不要追，等回调下方缩量的时候我们再进场就行了。</span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>4，白酒。</span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>白酒6月放了巨量，所以7月出现了大跌！但它不一定只回调一个月，后1-2个月继续回调是完全有可能的。所以中线不建议再做了。</span><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>下面有一个正V型底部形态支撑，也出现了反弹。我个人建议反弹到上方M头颈线就出掉，位置我已经画好了，就是这波下跌幅度的50%。</span></p><p><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-ratio=\"0.32328415651058373\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMOLbVspO1BcRkkFeOztgycA6nA5RFsZ3VrBKeLeibEibm4hLNk5UZGIKgia3ia7j8jicFffCNIaqPWkTTg/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1559\" style=\"\"/></p><p><br style='box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'/><span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"SF Pro Display\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;text-align: start;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>这段时间做好大盘回调震荡的准备，把精力放在板块轮动上。多去找一找那些量能正常，出现小阳线或中阳线的板块。真正健康的上涨，都是在不温不火中进行的。</span><br/></p></div>",
